{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "c8b4349a-4e2f-8a71-8980-00b541b66828",
  "created_at": "2026-03-02T14:40:07-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Thomas Lawton",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Kevin Sousa",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T14:35:11-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Kevin."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T14:35:14-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hello, Kevin. Good afternoon. How is your day going so far? Not too busy, I hope."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T14:35:22-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Not bad at all, thanks for asking. Monday afternoon, so it's steady. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T14:35:31-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, yes. My name is Thomas Lawton. I am calling for my mother, she is the one who lives in the house. The trash, um, it was not picked up. Not on the usual day."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T14:35:48-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, sorry about that. What's the address?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T14:35:52-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four twenty-seven Eustis Avenue. Up on the Hill."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T14:35:57-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four twenty-seven Eustis. Got it. And what's the usual pickup day there?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T14:36:03-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Is Friday. Every Friday, the truck comes in the morning, before ten, usually. My mother put the barrel out Thursday night, like always."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T14:36:14-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, so last Friday, that'd be the twenty-seventh. Nothing got picked up at all?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T14:36:21-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Nothing. The barrel is still full, the lid, it is closed, nobody touched. And the blue bin for recycling, also the same. I went by Saturday morning and it was still on the curb."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T14:36:37-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Alright. Did you see whether the neighbors' bins got picked up? Sometimes the whole street gets skipped."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T14:36:46-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hm, let me think. I did not look at the neighbors. Only at my mother's. Sorry, I should have looked."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T14:36:56-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, that's fine. I'm just writing it down. Eustis Avenue, Friday pickup, missed trash and recycling, bins out Thursday night. Is the barrel still at the curb now?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T14:37:10-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, no. I brought it back to the side of the house Saturday. It is a lot of trash now, you know, because it is two weeks nearly. My mother, she does not like when it smells."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T14:37:28-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. So what I can do is put in a missed pickup report so a crew can come out. When you put it back out, they'd want it at the curb by early morning."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T14:37:44-05:00",
      "duration": 21,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, yes, I can do that. I can put it out tonight. But, Kevin, I would like if a supervisor can call me back. I want to understand why it was missed. If it is the truck, or the street, or something with the schedule."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T14:38:05-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, I can ask for a supervisor to give you a call. I can't tell you why from here, I'm just seeing the report side. Is this the best number? Is it the landline you're on?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T14:38:22-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, this is the number. Four-oh-one, five-five-five, oh-one-five-nine."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T14:38:27-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four-oh-one, five-five-five, oh-one-five-nine. And it's Thomas, T-H-O-M-A-S, Lawton?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T14:38:32-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, Lawton, L-A-W-T-O-N. Is correct."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T14:38:35-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Great. And is there a good time to reach you? I'll note it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T14:38:42-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Afternoon is better. After one o'clock. In the morning I am at work, I cannot always answer."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T14:38:51-05:00",
      "duration": 20,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Afternoons, after one. Okay. I'll flag it as a callback request to a supervisor, and the missed pickup goes in with it. They're usually pretty good about getting back within a day or two, but I can't promise the exact hour."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T14:39:11-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That is okay. A day or two is fine. And the trash, will they come tomorrow, you think?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T14:39:20-05:00",
      "duration": 20,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Could be tomorrow, could be later in the week, depends on the route. Just leave it out at the curb so they don't miss it again, and if it's still sitting there by Wednesday evening, call back and we'll follow up."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T14:39:40-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Wednesday evening, if it is still there. I will tell my mother."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T14:39:47-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Perfect. Anything else I can help with today?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T14:39:52-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, that is everything. Thank you, Kevin, you were very kind. I hope the rest of your day goes easy."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T14:40:02-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too, Thomas. Take care."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T14:40:05-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Goodbye."
    }
  ],
